          "text": "Converted accelerated approval to full approval based on confirmatory phase 3 MIRASOL trial for platinum-resistant ovarian cancer",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics license application provides for the submission of the study report from the confirmatory phase 3 study IMGN853-0416 (MIRASOL), titled, *\"A randomized, open-label, Phase 3 study of Mirvetuximab soravtansine vs. Investigator's choice chemotherapy in platinum-resistant, advanced, high-grade epithelial ovarian, primary peritoneal, or fallopian tube cancers with high folate receptor-alpha expression,\"* to satisfy the postmarketing requirement 4347-1 of the previous accelerated approval of mirvetuximab soravtansine-gynx.",
